Three.js yordamida haqiqiy real-time 3D sahna yarat.

Talablar:
- Perspective camera.
- Antialiasing imkoniyati.
- PBR materiallar.
- Ambient lighting.
- Directional light.
- Shadow mapping.
- Fog va atmospheric depth.
